<h1>Reflecting on the Project</h1>
<p>As students work on their projects, balancing structure with creative freedom is key. Thoughtful planning, guided problem-solving, and opportunities for peer collaboration will help them turn their ideas into meaningful, well-executed code.</p>

<p><b>Head to the Padlet below and share your thinking:</b></p>
<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 16px 0;">
<p>How will you support students in breaking down their ideas into manageable coding tasks while still allowing for creative freedom in their projects?</p>
</div>

